OL,3,GNEWSABe bolder with apple choices to
OL,4,Aboost sales, says farmer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer says fruit growers need to be
OL,7,Fmore adventurous with their choice of
OL,8,Fapple varieties to help sales following
OL,9,Fa tough year for yields.
OL,11,FThe summer's record-breaking
OL,12,Ftemperatures and lack of rain have led
OL,13,Fto many struggles for farmers across
OL,14,Fthe country, with many crops failing to
OL,15,Fgrow.
OL,17,FHenry Dobell owns Moat Farm in Kenton
OL,18,Fnear Debenham, Suffolk, where he grows
OL,19,F15 varieties of apples. He says that in
OL,20,Fhis 21-year career it has been the most
OL,21,Fchallenging season - with many of the
OL,22,Fapples struggling to grow.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
