OL,3,GNEWSABe bolder with apple choices to
OL,4,Aboost sales, says farmer
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he was struggling to sell
OL,7,Ftraditional English apples in volume
OL,8,Fand believed that, as a nation, we had
OL,9,F"lost a taste for interesting,
OL,10,Fdelicious, fresh, seasonal apples".
